# Next's build output, local environment files, and the two files it writes
# by itself: next-env.d.ts, and an AGENTS.md block that `next dev` re-adds on
# every run (farhand-web). This project's instructions are written by the
# people working on it — CLAUDE.md at the root — so a generated one is treated
# as build output.
.next/
.env*.local
next-env.d.ts
farhand-web/AGENTS.md

# TypeScript's incremental build cache.
*.tsbuildinfo
